<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/46/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act shall come into operation on a date to be appointed by the Minister by notification in the Gazette. Amendment of section 30"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/46/eng@> .
